  annotation = {中文辅助译名：论我国海洋生态补偿制度建设},
  abstract = {The construction of the marine ecological compensation system is not only essential to the marine economic development,but also required by sustainable development.The outdated legislative philosophy of China‘s marine ecological compensation system has led to the problems such as inadequate legislation,inefficient law enforcement and incomplete judicial protection.When we choose the way out for our marine ecological compensation system,efforts should be made in the following aspects: to perfect ecological compensation legal system and improve the management system;to focus on environmental economic methods,broaden the capital channels,and turn the marine ecological compensation from blood transfusion toblood production;to bolster publicity and education,increase public participation in the marine ecological compensation,and strengthen judicial protection of marine ecological compensation.},
}

