  annotation = {中文辅助译名：基于FMCEA的六渡寨水库风险分析},
  abstract = {Risk analysis has been widely applied in hydropower field in developed countries since it can provide basis for fund allocating and decision making of managers.Using FMECA risk analysis and referring the risk analysis standard of Canadian BC Hydropower Corporation,we conducted discussion and risk degree analysis on the dam,spillway and diversion tunnel of Liuduzhai Reservoir in Hunan Province before and after the project reinforcement.The analysis showed the severe risk existed in the main structure of Liuduzhai Reservoir.We pointed out the priority order of the reinforcement work.By taking engineering measures and strengthening safety monitoring,the failure probability of the structures can be effectively reduced.The analysis results provide valuable references for safety evaluation,risk removal and reinforcement design of reservoir projects.},
